  "description": "Keep related projects and recent conversations within reach, without replacing BB's native workspace tree. Group subprojects into workspaces and page each project's chat families (1–100, default 5). Switch to the latest 50 conversations, search titles and projects, and see work and unread status together. Includes repository-local Source Control; requires BB 0.48.1+, SDK 0.6.104+, Node 24.20.0+ and the built-in thread-list.",
